        },
        {
          "text": "“Olunaku olwo bwe lulituuka, buli kifo aghaabanga emizabbibu olukumi (1,000), nga buli mulala gujaamu ebitundu bya feeza lukumi, ghalizika ghaameragho nkandwa na mawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
